{"id":"v75b92hozhpzvdtiaruvowdxc","title":"ODC Explorer：一个本地浏览的IPFS目录浏览器","originalTitle":"Introducing ODC Explorer","summary":"ODC Explorer 是一个本地运行的IPFS目录浏览器，无需搜索引擎或中间人服务器，提供高度隐私保护。它直接从IPFS读取目录，不记录查询日志，不发送任何数据到第三方，确保内容完整性和不可篡改。项目已支持Linux，使用Python 3.9+和Flask运行，目前仍在开发中。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Reddit r/opensource"},"links":{"original":"https://www.reddit.com/r/opensource/comments/1xtm8xg/introducing_odc_explorer/"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T16:28:58.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T17:21:00.935Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T17:21:00.935Z","category":"cool-repos","tags":["新项目","GitHub"],"score":43,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"5f21e477-54b8-451b-98fe-a1d4e2e26122","title":"ODC Explorer发布：本地IPFS目录浏览器强调隐私保护"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"/u/ki4jgt","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"5f21e477-54b8-451b-98fe-a1d4e2e26122","title":"ODC Explorer发布：本地IPFS目录浏览器强调隐私保护"}],"topics":[{"slug":"github","name":"GitHub"},{"slug":"new-project","name":"新项目首发"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fTjytXev7qMU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}